    "pitch_scaling": "T60(f) = T60(A3) * sqrt(220 Hz / f), f the note fundamental, for every partial"
  },
  "derivation": "For each retained recording, compare-partials of the file against itself over 0.5..4.5 s after onset with 512 ms windows; the fundamental track's late slope gives T60 = 60 / |slope|, divided by sqrt(220 / f0) to give the A3 anchor. The bar partial (5.9..6.1 x f0) uses the same rule where its track qualifies. The constants are the geometric means rounded to 20 s and 2.3 s.",
